{#
================================================================================
模块0: 封面 (Cover Page)
文件: 0_cover.jinja2
版本: v1.2
描述: 基线定位分析报告封面页模板
关联CSS: 0_cover.css

================================================================================
更新日志:
================================================================================
v1.2 - 2026-02-26
  - 变量名对齐 Schema 定义：data.meta → data.cover_meta，meta_raw → cover_meta_raw，meta → cover_meta
  - 更新默认值：default_badge_text "智慧诊学" → "方向比速度重要"
  - 更新默认值：default_footer 更新为 Schema 中定义的格式化字符串
  - 同步更新注释中的字段引用（cover.meta.* → cover.cover_meta.*）

v1.1 - 2026-01-15
  - 增加兼容层，支持 render_payload.cover 或直接 cover 两种传参方式
  - 增加 report_output.cover_meta 字段名映射兼容（city_name→city, total_questions→question_count）

================================================================================
数据结构 (Data Structure Example):
================================================================================

方式1: 适配层构造后的标准结构（推荐）
{
  "cover": {
    "badge_text": "方向比速度重要",
    "brand": {
      "logo_url": "assets/logo_dida985.png",
      "brand_name": "dida985"
    },
    "title": "基线定位分析报告",
    "subject": "数学",
    "cover_meta": {
      "city": "上海",
      "grade": "九年级",
      "report_generated_at": "2026-02-26",
      "question_count": 188,
      "report_date": "2025-01-15"
    },
    "footer_tagline": "{student_display_name}专属分析\n基于"历年真题考点"大数据"
  }
}

方式2: report_output.cover_meta 原始结构（模板内部兼容）
{
  "cover": {
    "cover_meta": {
      "city_name": "上海",
      "grade": "九年级",
      "report_generated_at": "2026-02-26",
      "total_questions": 188,
      "report_date": "2025-01-15"
    }
  }
}

================================================================================
字段说明:
================================================================================
| 模板字段                           | 原始字段(report_output)     | 类型          | 必填 | 说明                           |
|-----------------------------------|----------------------------|--------------|------|-------------------------------|
| cover.badge_text                  | -                          | string       | 否   | 顶部徽标文字，默认"方向比速度重要" |
| cover.brand.logo_url              | -                          | string       | 否   | Logo图片URL                    |
| cover.brand.brand_name            | -                          | string       | 否   | 品牌名，默认"dida985"           |
| cover.title                       | -                          | string       | 否   | 报告主标题，默认"基线定位分析报告" |
| cover.subject                     | -                          | string       | 否   | 学科名称，默认"数学"             |
| cover.cover_meta.city             | cover_meta.city_name       | string|null  | 否   | 城市名称                        |
| cover.cover_meta.grade            | cover_meta.grade           | string|null  | 否   | 年级                           |
| cover.cover_meta.report_generated_at | cover_meta.report_generated_at | string|null  | 否   | 报告生成时间                    |
| cover.cover_meta.question_count   | cover_meta.total_questions | number|null  | 否   | 分析题量                        |
| cover.cover_meta.report_date      | cover_meta.report_date     | string|null  | 否   | 报告日期（预留）                 |
| cover.footer_tagline              | -                          | string       | 否   | 底部标语文字                     |

================================================================================
空值处理规则:
================================================================================
- badge_text: 空值时显示 "方向比速度重要"
- brand.logo_url: 空值时显示Logo占位符
- brand.brand_name: 空值时显示 "dida985"
- title: 空值时显示 "基线定位分析报告"
- subject: 空值时显示 "数学"
- cover_meta.city / city_name: 空值时显示 "--"
- cover_meta.grade: 空值时显示 "--"
- cover_meta.report_generated_at: 空值时显示 "--"
- cover_meta.question_count / total_questions: 空值时显示 "--题"
- footer_tagline: 空值时显示默认标语

================================================================================
状态类说明（封面模块不使用，但保持一致性定义）:
================================================================================
- .m0-status--achieved  : 达标/良好状态（绿色）
- .m0-status--attention : 需关注状态（橙色）
- .m0-status--improve   : 待提升状态（红色）
- .m0-status--nodata    : 无数据状态（灰色）

================================================================================
#}

{# ========================================================================
   兼容层 - 支持多种传参方式
   ======================================================================== #}

{# 方式1: render(**render_payload) 直接摊平，cover 在顶层 #}
{# 方式2: render(cover=...) 直接传入 cover #}
{# 方式3: render(render_payload=...) 包装传入 #}
{% set _cover_raw = cover | default(render_payload.cover | default({})) %}

{# ========================================================================
   变量预处理 - 设置默认值 & 字段名映射
   ======================================================================== #}
{% set data = _cover_raw %}
{% set brand = data.brand | default({}) %}
{% set cover_meta_raw = data.cover_meta | default({}) %}
{% set _summary = summary | default({}) %}

{# 字段名映射兼容：支持 report_output 原始字段名 #}
{% set cover_meta = {
    'city': cover_meta_raw.city | default(cover_meta_raw.city_name | default(none)),
    'grade': cover_meta_raw.grade | default(none),
    'report_generated_at': cover_meta_raw.report_generated_at | default(none),
    'question_count': cover_meta_raw.question_count | default(cover_meta_raw.total_questions | default(none)),
    'report_date': cover_meta_raw.report_date | default(none),
    'exam_name': cover_meta_raw.exam_name | default(meta.exam_name | default(none)),
    'trend': cover_meta_raw.trend | default(_summary.current_trend | default(none))
} %}
{% set trend_map = {'up': '上升', 'down': '下降', 'stable': '稳定'} %}
{% set cover_trend_label = trend_map[cover_meta.trend] if cover_meta.trend in trend_map else (cover_meta.trend | default(none)) %}

{# 默认值定义 #}
{% set default_badge_text = "方向比速度重要" %}
{% set default_brand_name = "dida985" %}
{% set default_title = "基线定位分析报告" %}
{% set default_subject = "数学" %}
{% set default_footer = '{student_display_name}专属分析\n逐题透析·逐点拆解·对标历年真题考点' %}
{% set empty_placeholder = "--" %}

{# ========================================================================
   封面页主容器
   ======================================================================== #}
<div class="m0-cover-page">
  <div class="m0-cover-content">

    {# ====================================================================
       1. 品牌区 - Logo + 品牌名（顶部小尺寸）
       ==================================================================== #}
    <div class="m0-cover-brand">
      {# Logo图片 - 带空值防护 #}
      {% if brand.logo_url %}
        <img
          class="m0-cover-brand__logo"
          src="{{ brand.logo_url }}"
          alt="{{ brand.brand_name | default(default_brand_name) }} logo"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
        />
        {# Logo占位符（图片加载失败时显示） #}
        <div class="m0-cover-brand__logo-placeholder" style="display: none;">
          D
        </div>
      {% else %}
        {# 无Logo URL时显示占位符 #}
        <div class="m0-cover-brand__logo-placeholder">
          D
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {# 品牌名 #}
      <div class="m0-cover-brand__name">
        {{- brand.brand_name | default(default_brand_name) -}}
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ====================================================================
       2. 学生信息 — 第一视觉焦点
       ==================================================================== #}
    {% set _student = meta.student_display_name | default(empty_placeholder, true) %}
    {% set _report_generated_at = cover_meta.report_generated_at | default('', true) %}
    {% set _report_display_time = _report_generated_at | replace('T', ' ') %}
    {% set _report_date = cover_meta.report_date | default(_report_display_time, true) %}
    {% set _question_count = cover_meta.question_count | default(none, true) %}
    {% set _appendix_data = appendix | default({}, true) %}
    {% set _appendix_papers = _appendix_data.papers | default({}, true) %}
    {% set _paper_count = cover_meta_raw.paper_count | default(_appendix_papers.total_papers | default(none), true) %}
    {% set _target_score_text = _summary.target_score_text | default(meta.target_score_text | default('', true), true) %}
    {% if not _target_score_text and meta.target_score | default(none, true) is not none %}
      {% set _target_score_text = meta.target_score ~ '分+' %}
    {% endif %}
    <div class="m0-cover-exclusive">
      <div class="m0-cover-exclusive__name">{{ _student }}</div>
      {# 评估时间紧跟姓名，形成"姓名+时间"视觉焦点 #}
      {% if _report_display_time %}
      <div class="m0-cover-exclusive__time">{{ _report_display_time }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="m0-cover-exclusive__label">专属分析</div>
    </div>

    {# ====================================================================
       3. 封面信息 - 城市/年级/学科/考试/趋势/分析试卷
       ==================================================================== #}
    <section class="m0-cover-dossier" aria-label="封面信息">
      <div class="m0-cover-meta">
        <div class="m0-cover-meta__item">
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__label">城市</div>
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__value{% if not cover_meta.city %} m0-cover-meta__value--empty{% endif %}">
            {{- cover_meta.city | default(empty_placeholder, true) -}}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="m0-cover-meta__item">
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__label">年级</div>
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__value{% if not cover_meta.grade %} m0-cover-meta__value--empty{% endif %}">
            {{- cover_meta.grade | default(empty_placeholder, true) -}}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="m0-cover-meta__item">
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__label">学科</div>
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__value m0-cover-meta__value--subject">
            {{- data.subject | default(default_subject, true) -}}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="m0-cover-meta__item">
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__label">考试</div>
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__value{% if not cover_meta.exam_name %} m0-cover-meta__value--empty{% endif %}">
            {{- cover_meta.exam_name | default(empty_placeholder, true) -}}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="m0-cover-meta__item">
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__label">目标分数</div>
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__value{% if not _target_score_text %} m0-cover-meta__value--empty{% endif %}">
            {{- _target_score_text | default(empty_placeholder, true) -}}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="m0-cover-meta__item">
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__label">分析试卷</div>
          <div class="m0-cover-meta__value{% if _paper_count is none and _question_count is none %} m0-cover-meta__value--empty{% endif %}">
            {%- if _paper_count is not none -%}
              {{ _paper_count }}套
            {%- elif _question_count is not none -%}
              {{ _question_count }}题
            {%- else -%}
              {{ empty_placeholder }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {# ====================================================================
       4. 分隔线
       ==================================================================== #}
    <div class="m0-cover-divider"></div>

    {# ====================================================================
       5. 标题区 - 报告名称（学生信息之后）
       ==================================================================== #}
    <div class="m0-cover-title">
      <div class="m0-cover-title__main">
        {{- data.title | default(default_title) -}}
      </div>
      {# 学科已移至元信息区突出显示，此处不再重复 #}
    </div>

    {# ====================================================================
       6. 标语 — 弱化存在感
       ==================================================================== #}
    <div class="m0-cover-badge">
      {{- data.badge_text | default(default_badge_text) -}}
    </div>

    {# ====================================================================
       7. 底部备案信息 (margin-top:auto 推到页面最底部)
       ==================================================================== #}
    <div class="m0-cover-compliance">
      <div class="m0-cover-compliance__filing">网信算备310112946964101260015号</div>
      <div class="m0-cover-compliance__authority">依据《国家互联网信息办公室》《中华人民共和国工业和信息化部》《中华人民共和国公安部》要求，本算法已通过审查完成备案。</div>
      <div class="m0-cover-compliance__disclaimer">本报告由AI人工智能生成，请结合实际情况使用</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>